| <span lang="ja">Context間の関係</span><span lang="en">Context relationships</span> | <span lang="ja">第14章／戦略的設計の部</span><span lang="en">Ch 14 / strategic-design part</span> | <span lang="ja">第3・13章：Context Mapと接続</span><span lang="en">Ch 3 and 13: maps and integration</span> | <span lang="ja">第4章：関係・変換・Context Map</span><span lang="en">Ch 4: relationships, translation and maps</span> |
| <span lang="ja">Entity・Value Object</span><span lang="en">Entity/Value Object</span> | <span lang="ja">第5章：モデルの基本要素</span><span lang="en">Ch 5: model elements</span> | <span lang="ja">第5・6章：個別の要素</span><span lang="en">Ch 5–6: separate building blocks</span> | <span lang="ja">第6章冒頭：Domain Modelの構成要素</span><span lang="en">Ch 6 opening: Domain Model building blocks</span> |
| <span lang="ja">Aggregate</span><span lang="en">Aggregate</span> | <span lang="ja">第6章：ライフサイクルの章を照合対象とする</span><span lang="en">Ch 6 lifecycle: definition inspection target</span> | <span lang="ja">第10章：公開本文で整合性境界を確認</span><span lang="en">Ch 10: public consistency-boundary excerpt</span> | <span lang="ja">第6章：構成要素として言及</span><span lang="en">Ch 6: named as a building block</span> |
| <span lang="ja">Repository</span><span lang="en">Repository</span> | <span lang="ja">第6章：ライフサイクルの章を照合対象とする</span><span lang="en">Ch 6 lifecycle: definition inspection target</span> | <span lang="ja">第12章：独立した章</span><span lang="en">Ch 12: dedicated chapter</span> | <span lang="ja">第6章冒頭：構成要素として言及</span><span lang="en">Ch 6 opening: named building block</span> |
| <span lang="ja">Domain Event</span><span lang="en">Domain Event</span> | <span lang="ja">今回の公開確認範囲では位置未確認</span><span lang="en">Location unverified in inspected public material</span> | <span lang="ja">第8章：独立した章</span><span lang="en">Ch 8: dedicated chapter</span> | <span lang="ja">第9・15章：連携・イベントの関連範囲</span><span lang="en">Ch 9/15: communication/event coverage</span> |
| <span lang="ja">CQRS</span><span lang="en">CQRS</span> | <span lang="ja">今回の公開確認範囲では位置未確認</span><span lang="en">Location unverified in inspected public material</span> | <span lang="ja">第4章／出版社が対応アーキテクチャとして明示</span><span lang="en">Ch 4 / explicit publisher architecture coverage</span> | <span lang="ja">第8章：更新・参照モデル分離</span><span lang="en">Ch 8: update/read model separation</span> |

<span lang="ja">確認できる違いには、用語の定義だけでなく整理の範囲があります。Eはモデルの基本要素と後半の戦略的設計、Vは基本要素の個別章とアーキテクチャ・連携、Kは戦略的／戦術的設計とアーキテクチャの選択を明示して構成しています。K第6章の公開本文は、戦術的パターン群をDomain Modelの構成要素として説明する立場を示しています。V第10章の公開本文はAggregateを不変条件とトランザクションの整合性境界として具体化します。これらは説明範囲・強調点の違いとして扱い、確認していない定義の対立は断定しません。</span><span lang="en">Verified differences include organization and emphasis. E separates model building blocks and later strategic design; V gives individual building-block chapters and architecture/integration; K explicitly organizes strategic/tactical design and architecture choices. The K Chapter 6 preview treats tactical patterns as Domain Model building blocks. The V Chapter 10 excerpt develops Aggregate invariants and transactional consistency boundaries. These observations concern scope/emphasis, not an asserted disagreement between uninspected definitions.</span>

<span lang="ja">次の表は、本技術ガイドで採用する意味とSimpleModelingへの接続です。各書の定義を同一と仮定せず、出典の観点と本システムの採用方針を区別します。「位置未確認」は今回の公開確認範囲を示すもので、書籍全体にその概念が登場しないという判断ではありません。</span><span lang="en">The following meanings are adopted for this guide and connected to SimpleModeling. Source perspectives and system policy remain distinct rather than assuming identical definitions. Location unverified describes this public inspection scope, not absence from an entire book.</span>

