## Related Architecture and Platform Techniques｜関連アーキテクチャ・基盤技術

<span lang="ja">更新・参照、非同期の連携、処理の進行、モデル駆動UI、メモリ管理、部品の構成・配布を支える技術をまとめます。DDD・PoEAAで整理した業務の意味と責務を、実行基盤の構成へつなぐために利用します。</span><span lang="en">These techniques support writes and reads, asynchronous coordination, progression, model-driven UI, memory management, and component composition and delivery. They connect business meaning and responsibilities organized through DDD and PoEAA to runtime architecture.</span>

