# References and Inspection Scope｜参考資料と確認範囲

<span lang="ja">Eric Evans, Domain-Driven Design: Tackling Complexity in the Heart of Software。業務の意味、Ubiquitous Language、Bounded Context、Entity・Value・Aggregateなどの基本概念の参照先。https://www.informit.com/store/domain-driven-design-tackling-complexity-in-the-heart-9780321125217</span><span lang="en">Eric Evans, Domain-Driven Design: Tackling Complexity in the Heart of Software. Foundation for business meaning, Ubiquitous Language, Bounded Contexts, Entities, Values and Aggregates. https://www.informit.com/store/domain-driven-design-tackling-complexity-in-the-heart-9780321125217</span>

<span lang="ja">Vaughn Vernon, Implementing Domain-Driven Design。基本概念を実装とアーキテクチャへ接続する際の参照先。https://www.informit.com/store/implementing-domain-driven-design-9780321834577</span><span lang="en">Vaughn Vernon, Implementing Domain-Driven Design. Reference for connecting core concepts to implementation and architecture. https://www.informit.com/store/implementing-domain-driven-design-9780321834577</span>

<span lang="ja">Vlad Khononov, Learning Domain-Driven Design。戦略的設計・戦術的設計・アーキテクチャ上の選択を整理する参照先。https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/learning-domain-driven-design/9781098100124/</span><span lang="en">Vlad Khononov, Learning Domain-Driven Design. Reference for strategic and tactical design and architectural choices. https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/learning-domain-driven-design/9781098100124/</span>

<span lang="ja">Martin Fowler, Patterns of Enterprise Application Architecture。本文のService Layer、Repository、Data Mapper、Unit of Workは公開パターン・カタログも参照しています。https://martinfowler.com/eaaCatalog/ 。CQRS：https://martinfowler.com/bliki/CQRS.html 。DDDの補助資料：Eric Evans, Domain-Driven Design Reference。https://www.domainlanguage.com/ddd/reference/</span><span lang="en">Martin Fowler, Patterns of Enterprise Application Architecture. The public catalog also supports the guide’s Service Layer, Repository, Data Mapper and Unit of Work mappings: https://martinfowler.com/eaaCatalog/ . CQRS: https://martinfowler.com/bliki/CQRS.html . Supplementary DDD reference: Eric Evans, Domain-Driven Design Reference, https://www.domainlanguage.com/ddd/reference/</span>

<span lang="ja">Scott Wlaschin, Domain Modeling Made Functional。本文「Entityと両系統のValue Object」の型・値の制約との対応で参照します。F#での実装手法の詳細は本技術ガイドでは扱いません。https://pragprog.com/titles/swdddf/domain-modeling-made-functional/</span><span lang="en">Scott Wlaschin, Domain Modeling Made Functional. Referenced for types and value constraints in “Entities and Value Objects across Both Paths.” Detailed F# implementation techniques are outside this guide. https://pragprog.com/titles/swdddf/domain-modeling-made-functional/</span>

<span lang="ja">Debasish Ghosh, Functional and Reactive Domain Modeling。本文「モデルの意味と処理系の責務」の業務計算と入出力処理の分離との対応で参照します。Scalaによる関数型モデリングの詳説は別文書の対象とします。https://www.manning.com/books/functional-and-reactive-domain-modeling</span><span lang="en">Debasish Ghosh, Functional and Reactive Domain Modeling. Referenced for separating domain calculations from I/O in “Model Meaning and Platform Responsibilities.” Detailed functional modeling in Scala belongs in the separate document. https://www.manning.com/books/functional-and-reactive-domain-modeling</span>

<span lang="ja">内部資料：SimpleModeling.orgの2026-10-16「CNCFシリーズ構想 - DDDモデルを実行し、KnowledgeとAIへ接続するRuntime」と2026-10-17「Domain Rule / Rule Engineをハーネス・シリーズとCNCF記事へ接続する」。CozyのCML Semantic Capability Inventory、ModelTypeProjector実装、Generated StateMachine/Workflow ABI Contract。</span><span lang="en">Internal sources: SimpleModeling.org journals of 2026-10-16 on executing DDD models in CNCF and 2026-10-17 on Domain Rule / Rule Engine integration; Cozy’s CML Semantic Capability Inventory, ModelTypeProjector implementation, and Generated StateMachine/Workflow ABI Contract.</span>

<span lang="ja">内部資料：CNCFのAggregate/View Semantic Boundary、Entity Runtime Architecture、Textus Subsystem Runtime Architecture、Entity Conflict and Conditional Transition、Action Execution Semantics、Rule Engine and Inference Runtime。これらの設計・仕様と実装の位置付けを区別して参照しています。 Display Model runtime designとDisplay Model runtime specificationは、ViewとDisplayの責務分離および操作の接続の参照先です。 DataStore and Aggregate Persistence Model、DataStore logical type mapping、UnitOfWork Resource Lifecycle、Canonical Event Shapeも参照しています。 Entity Kind and Working Set PolicyとEntityKindRuntimePolicyの実装は、分類とメモリ管理の対応の参照先です。</span><span lang="en">Internal sources: CNCF’s Aggregate/View Semantic Boundary, Entity Runtime Architecture, Textus Subsystem Runtime Architecture, Entity Conflict and Conditional Transition, Action Execution Semantics, and Rule Engine and Inference Runtime. Design contracts, specifications and implementation evidence are treated according to their respective scope. Display Model runtime design and specification establish the View/Display responsibility split and action integration. Further internal references are DataStore and Aggregate Persistence Model, DataStore logical type mapping, UnitOfWork Resource Lifecycle and Canonical Event Shape. Entity Kind and Working Set Policy and the EntityKindRuntimePolicy implementation establish the classification-to-memory-policy mapping.</span>

<span lang="ja">比較の公開出典：Eの目次 https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/domain-driven-design-tackling/0321125215/toc.html 、第5章の冒頭 https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/domain-driven-design-tackling/0321125215/ch05.html 。Vの目次は前掲出版社ページ、第10章の整合性境界の公開本文 https://www.informit.com/articles/article.aspx?p=2020371&seqNum=2 。Kの目次は前掲出版社ページ、第3章の文脈依存の用語例 https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/learning-domain-driven-design/9781098100124/ch03.html 、第6章の用語整理 https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/learning-domain-driven-design/9781098100124/ch06.html 。全文照合や不掲載の証明は、この公開確認の対象外です。</span><span lang="en">Public comparison sources: E contents https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/domain-driven-design-tackling/0321125215/toc.html and Chapter 5 opening https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/domain-driven-design-tackling/0321125215/ch05.html ; V contents at the cited publisher page and the Chapter 10 consistency-boundary excerpt https://www.informit.com/articles/article.aspx?p=2020371&seqNum=2 ; K contents at the cited publisher page, context-dependent language in Chapter 3 https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/learning-domain-driven-design/9781098100124/ch03.html and terminology in Chapter 6 https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/learning-domain-driven-design/9781098100124/ch06.html . This public inspection does not establish full-text equivalence or absence.</span>
